SHEPARD - a program card for the Music Thing Modular Workshop System Computer
Copyright (c) 2026 Andy Jenkinson (uglifruit)

Built on the ComputerCard library by Chris Johnson, and reusing fixed-point
helpers (MulQ15, the soft clippers, and the boot/paging logic) from the
author's own WorkshopSpectral card:

    https://github.com/uglifruit/WorkshopSpectral

